{
  "about": "Sampled KEYS instruments. Files are fetched and converted by scripts/fetch-instruments.mjs into public/samples/instruments/<id>/<note>.flac. Notes are MIDI numbers (C4 = 60), the pitch each file really plays (VCSL piano, kalimba and VSCO strings are named an octave low). A sample's `cents` is how sharp the recording is; fetch-instruments retunes it to the exact note. An instrument's `pads` are extra notes rendered as pad_<note>.flac (from the nearest sample) for a pad kit in kits.json. Order matches PRESETS.sampled in src/keys/types.ts.",
  "licence": "CC0 1.0 (public domain dedication)",
